not something a recipient of `dist/` has. Pointing at
`epaint_default_fonts-0.35.0/fonts/` was honest for someone reading this source
tree and invisible to someone holding the zip -- which is exactly how the gap
survived being recorded correctly. The copies below are byte-identical to the
crate's, hashed here, and copied into the release directory by
`tools/release.ps1`, which refuses to ship without them.

